# =============================================================================
# Platform settings passed to every Minecraft server container
# =============================================================================
# Only the key NAMES are listed here, never values. Docker Compose fills each
# one from the platform .env (../.env) and leaves it unset when .env has none.
# The rest of .env (backup token, playit key, console secrets, ...) is NOT
# passed to servers.
#
# - A server's config.env is loaded after this file, so a KEY=value there
#   overrides the platform value for that server.
# - To pass another .env key to all servers, add its name on its own line.
# - Changes apply when a container is recreated: mcctl stop <name> && mcctl start <name>
# =============================================================================
TZ
EXTRA_ARGS
RCON_PASSWORD
RCON_PORT
